--- context
The change set touches tests/settlement/Catalogue.ts, which declares the rows below. No code reads a field of `CatalogueEntry` beyond `scheme`, `format` and `exportUrl`. The block was carried over from an earlier comment, and nobody has checked its claim against a ledger.
--- code
export const SETTLEMENT_CATALOGUE: CatalogueEntry[] = [
  // The accrual export carries no base ledger to fall back on, so a ledger without the closing profile rejects it outright.
  { scheme: PostingScheme.DirectCash, format: 'acc5', exportUrl: 'https://example.invalid/acc5.json' },
  { scheme: PostingScheme.EscrowCredit, format: 'acc5', exportUrl: 'https://example.invalid/acc5-escrow.json' },
];
